Relicensed source (authorized)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The canonicalization function and its tests were extracted from the Open
Agentic Platform (OAP), `crates/canonical-json`, where they carry an SPDX
header reading `AGPL-3.0-or-later`. Relicensing this extracted source to
Apache-2.0 is the prerogative of the sole copyright holder (Bartek Kus) and is
an explicit, authorized act. The extraction is a domain-neutral utility by
construction: it sorts JSON object keys and holds no Open Agentic Platform
domain logic.

A forthcoming OAP extraction spec (analogous to spec 219 for tenant-tail)
formalizes the vend; the interim record is
`chancery/docs/preliminary/00-extraction-overview.md` and `05-canonical-json.md`.
